<title>ISRAEL: Israel Oil Refineries Q2 net profit plunges.</title>
<headline>Israel Oil Refineries Q2 net profit plunges.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil Refineries Ltd, 26 percent owned by the Israel Corp. The government owns the remaining shares.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		1,478,948   1,594,664  3,078,751   3,245,339</p>
<p>Operating profit	 4,074	20,704     35,998	78,325</p>
<p>Net profit (loss)    (17,192)     18,917	8,238	51,101</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
